lass="flex items-center gap-2"&gt;&#10; &lt;button&#10; class="collapse-code-btn text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary hover:bg-primary/10 focus:ring-primary/20 flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium transition-all duration-200 ease-out focus:ring-2 focus:outline-none"&#10; type="button"&#10; data-code-action="toggle-collapse"&#10; data-label-expand="확장"&#10; data-label-collapse="접기"&#10; title="접기"&#10; aria-label="접기"&#10; aria-controls="code-0"&#10; aria-expanded="true"&#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;span class="collapse-chevron transition-transform duration-200 ease-out"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="h-3 w-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;&#10; &lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="collapse-text hidden sm:inline"&gt;접기&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button&#10; class="copy-code-btn text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary hover:bg-primary/10 focus:ring-primary/20 flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium transition-all duration-200 ease-out focus:ring-2 focus:outline-none"&#10; type="button"&#10; data-code-action="copy"&#10; data-label-copy="복사"&#10; data-label-copied="복사됨"&#10; title="복사"&#10; aria-label="복사"&#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;span class="copy-icon"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="h-3 w-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;&#10; &lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z" /&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="copy-text hidden sm:inline"&gt;복사&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="code-block-content relative" id="code-0"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git clone -b llvmorg-10.0.0 https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project.git llvm10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;pre hidden data-code-source&gt;&lt;code&gt;git clone -b llvmorg-10.0.0 https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project.git llvm10&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div&#10; class="collapse-overlay to-card/90 pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-b from-transparent via-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300"&#10; hidden&#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;button&#10; class="collapse-overlay-btn text-muted-foreground bg-card/80 border-border/50 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary hover:border-primary/30 absolute bottom-4 left-1/2 flex -translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border p-2 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-200"&#10; type="button"&#10; data-code-action="expand"&#10; aria-label="확장"&#10; title="확장"&#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;&#10; &lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="configure"&gt;configure&lt;a href="#configure" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ninja를 사용하면 컴파일 시간을 많이 단축할 수 있다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>LLVM loop unroll and jam pass and view-cfg</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/llvm-loop-unroll-and-jam-pass-and-view-cfg/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/llvm-loop-unroll-and-jam-pass-and-view-cfg/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&#10; class="image-figure not-prose my-8"&#10; data-lightbox-enabled="&#10; true&#10; "&#10; data-gallery-type="auto"&#10; data-image-width="0"&#10; data-image-height="0"&#10; data-image-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/llvm.jpeg"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="image-container"&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/llvm.jpeg"&#10; alt="LLVM 프로젝트 로고인 은색 와이번(용) 그림"&#10; &#10; &#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; data-gallery-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/llvm.jpeg"&#10; data-gallery-alt="LLVM 프로젝트 로고인 은색 와이번(용) 그림"&#10; data-gallery-title=""&#10; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;대학원 컴파일러 수업에서 ML을 이용하여 unroll and jam을 판별하는 모델을 학습을 하는 term project를 진행하였다.&#10;unroll and jam pass는 이름에서 알 수 있듯이 loop 최적화에 관련된 pass로 unroll 과 jam을 수행하여 innermost loop body의 병렬성을 증가시켜서 제한된 resource의 utilization을 증가시키는 최적화이다.&#10;내 기억이 맞다면 O2 이상의 최적화 부터 적용되는데 opt의 debug를 통하여 볼때 생각보다 잘? 사용이 안된다.&#10;LLVM code를 보면 대부분 loop unroll과 loop fusion pass를 재활용하며 검사 정도만 하는데 이 때문에 da,lcssa,loop simplify가 조건을 만족하여도 unroll and jam pass가 동작되지 않는 경우가 많다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>간단논문 정리 End-to-End Deep Learning of Optimization Heuristics (PACT 17)</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-end-to-end-deep-learning-of-optimization-heuristics-pact-17/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-end-to-end-deep-learning-of-optimization-heuristics-pact-17/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;h2 id="제목"&gt;제목&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%9c%eb%aa%a9" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;End-to-End Deep Learning of Optimization Heuristics&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="저자"&gt;저자&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%80%ec%9e%90" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chris Cummins ; Pavlos Petoumenos ; Zheng Wang ; Hugh Leather&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>간단논문 정리 Fast and Effective Orchestration of Compiler Optimizations(Zhelong Pan,Rudolf Eigenmann;Purdue University ;CGO’06)</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-fast-and-effective-orchestration-of-compiler-optimizationszhelong-panrudolf-eigenmannpurdue-university-cgo06/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-fast-and-effective-orchestration-of-compiler-optimizationszhelong-panrudolf-eigenmannpurdue-university-cgo06/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;h2 id="제목"&gt;제목&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%9c%eb%aa%a9" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fast and Effective Orchestration of Compiler Optimizations&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="저자"&gt;저자&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%80%ec%9e%90" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zhelong Pan,Rudolf Eigenmann&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="motivation"&gt;Motivation&lt;a href="#motivation" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;compile-time optimizations 은 전반적으로 프로그램 성능을 향상시키지만 일부 기법은 성능 하락을 야기한다.&#10;입력프로그램와 target architecture에 대한 불충분한 정보는 컴파일 시간에 정확도 향상을 향상 시키는 모델의 한계를 만든다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>간단논문 정리 TVM An Automated End-to-End Optimizing Compiler for Deep Learning (OSDI 18)</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-tvm-an-automated-end-to-end-optimizing-compiler-for-deep-learning-osdi-18/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-tvm-an-automated-end-to-end-optimizing-compiler-for-deep-learning-osdi-18/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&#10; class="image-figure not-prose my-8"&#10; data-lightbox-enabled="&#10; true&#10; "&#10; data-gallery-type="auto"&#10; data-image-width="0"&#10; data-image-height="0"&#10; data-image-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/tvm1.png"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="image-container"&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/tvm1.png"&#10; alt="TVM 스택 도식. PyTorch·CoreML·TensorFlow·ONNX·Keras·MXNet 이 High-Level Differentiable IR 로 들어오고, Tensor Expression 과 최적화 탐색 공간을 거쳐 LLVM·CUDA·Metal 과 VTA 로 내려가며, AutoTVM 이 디바이스 플릿과 주고받으며 탐색한다"&#10; &#10; &#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; data-gallery-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/tvm1.png"&#10; data-gallery-alt="TVM 스택 도식. PyTorch·CoreML·TensorFlow·ONNX·Keras·MXNet 이 High-Level Differentiable IR 로 들어오고, Tensor Expression 과 최적화 탐색 공간을 거쳐 LLVM·CUDA·Metal 과 VTA 로 내려가며, AutoTVM 이 디바이스 플릿과 주고받으며 탐색한다"&#10; data-gallery-title=""&#10; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>논문 정리 Chameleon Adaptive Code Optimization for Expedited Deep Neural Network Compilation(ICLR 2020)</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-chameleon-adaptive-code-optimization-for-expedited-deep-neural-network-compilationiclr-2020/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-chameleon-adaptive-code-optimization-for-expedited-deep-neural-network-compilationiclr-2020/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&#10; class="image-figure not-prose my-8"&#10; data-lightbox-enabled="&#10; true&#10; "&#10; data-gallery-type="auto"&#10; data-image-width="0"&#10; data-image-height="0"&#10; data-image-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/chameleon1.jpg"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="image-container"&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/chameleon1.jpg"&#10; alt="CHAMELEON 의 전체 설계와 컴파일 흐름 도식의 축소판"&#10; &#10; &#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; data-gallery-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/chameleon1.jpg"&#10; data-gallery-alt="CHAMELEON 의 전체 설계와 컴파일 흐름 도식의 축소판"&#10; data-gallery-title=""&#10; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="제목"&gt;제목&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%9c%eb%aa%a9" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chameleon: Adaptive Code Optimization for Expedited Deep Neural Network Compilation&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>논문 정리 LLVM A Compilation Framework for Lifelong Program Analysis &amp; Transformation(CGO 04)</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-llvm-a-compilation-framework-for-lifelong-program-analysis-transformationcgo-04/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-llvm-a-compilation-framework-for-lifelong-program-analysis-transformationcgo-04/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;h2 id="제목"&gt;제목&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%9c%eb%aa%a9" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;LLVM: A Compilation Framework for Lifelong Program Analysis &amp;amp; Transformation&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="저자"&gt;저자&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%80%ec%9e%90" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chris Lattner Vikram Adve&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="개인적으로-느끼는-논문의-insight"&gt;개인적으로 느끼는 논문의 insight&lt;a href="#%ea%b0%9c%ec%9d%b8%ec%a0%81%ec%9c%bc%eb%a1%9c-%eb%8a%90%eb%81%bc%eb%8a%94-%eb%85%bc%eb%ac%b8%ec%9d%98-insight" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lifelong Program Analysis개념을 도입하여 Front-end를 제외한 부분에서 전체적인 최적화를 수행,SSA,machine-independent optimization&#10;논문에서 제시된 개념이 지금의 llvm과 정확하게 일치하지는 않지만 대단하다..&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>논문 정리 NeuroVectorizer End-to-End Vectorization with Deep Reinforcement Learning (CGO 20)</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-neurovectorizer-end-to-end-vectorization-with-deep-reinforcement-learning-cgo-20/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-neurovectorizer-end-to-end-vectorization-with-deep-reinforcement-learning-cgo-20/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&#10; class="image-figure not-prose my-8"&#10; data-lightbox-enabled="&#10; true&#10; "&#10; data-gallery-type="auto"&#10; data-image-width="0"&#10; data-image-height="0"&#10; data-image-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/nv1.png"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="image-container"&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/nv1.png"&#10; alt="NeuroVectorizer 프레임워크 개요 도식의 축소판"&#10; &#10; &#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; data-gallery-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/nv1.png"&#10; data-gallery-alt="NeuroVectorizer 프레임워크 개요 도식의 축소판"&#10; data-gallery-title=""&#10; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="제목"&gt;제목&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%9c%eb%aa%a9" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;NeuroVectorizer: End-to-End Vectorization with Deep Reinforcement Learning&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>